d><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>If you are standing at the sofa and facing the cabinet, the bookshelf is located to your right — which corresponds to \"front-right\" from the sofa's perspective, since the cabinet is ahead and the bookshelf extends to the right side of the cabinet.\n\n</spatial_thinking>\n\n<thinking><abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Standing at the sofa and facing the cabinet, the bookshelf is positioned to the right of the cabinet. Given the layout, the bookshelf is not behind or to the left of the cabinet but rather extends to its right side. Therefore, from the sofa’s perspective, looking toward the cabinet, the bookshelf is in the front-right direction.\n\nT<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Thus, the correct answer is D. front-right.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>D</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":5,"body_tokens":80,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":2,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source